{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>What is this service to you?</b> The rest of the services follow the seasons: the omer on the sixteenth of Nisan, because it is the barley-harvest season; the two loaves on the sixth of Sivan, because it is the wheat-harvest season; the four species of the lulav, because it is the fruit-gathering season. But this service on the fourteenth of Nisan — what is its nature? <b>And you shall say: a Passover sacrifice</b> etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:20.005510794Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}